flowchart TD
  A([Start]) --> B[Define or approve area]
  B --> C[Run monitor now or scheduler]
  C --> D[Search CDSE STAC]
  D --> E{Enough suitable observations?}
  E -- No --> F[Store status / explain no pair]
  F --> Z([End])
  E -- Yes --> G{Credentials + rasterio available?}
  G -- No --> H[Record blocked run]
  H --> Z
  G -- Yes --> I[Retrieve and preprocess image pair]
  I --> J[Baseline or model analysis]
  J --> K{Significant change?}
  K -- No --> L[Store analysis with no alert]
  K -- Yes --> M[Store finding, case and alert]
  L --> Z
  M --> N[Optional department routing / email]
  N --> Z
